            <div xml:id="d288-a1">

                <pb facs="0922" n="1712" xml:id="pg1712"/>

                <head>Annexe I</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Continental Shelf</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">article 2</hi></p>
                <p>The subsoil and seabed of the continental shelf appertain to the coastal state
                    and are subject to its jurisdiction, control and power of disposition.</p>
